text;\">Overall atrophy score as assessed in the biopsy samples obtained from the oxyntic mucosa</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"128\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210080335;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Score 0</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"128\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210080335;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Score 1</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"128\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210080335;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Score 2</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"128\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210080335;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Score 3</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"4\" width=\"321\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: right;\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210080335;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Antrum biopsy specimens</span></strong>